    ["<Red>Blood Freezing</>: After entering combat, the wearer's blood will gradually cool, reducing Stamina recovery speed until Stamina cannot be recovered at all. This effect can be alleviated or even eliminated by continuously dealing damage. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, two random Beyonder material entry attributes become ineffective for 15 seconds."] = "<Red>Blood Freezing</>: After entering combat, the wearer's blood will gradually cool, reducing Stamina recovery speed until Stamina cannot be recovered at all. This effect can be alleviated or even eliminated by continuously dealing damage. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, two random Потусторонний material entry attributes become ineffective for 15 seconds.",
